  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can quickly shrug off effects sapping your will.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Heroic Will<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can choose to use this feat as a swift or move action. If you use it as a standard action, you can expend a mythic surge as part of the same action and add the result to your second save. You can use this feat more than once per day by expending one use of mythic power for each additional use.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
